<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight rates, one week widen.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight rates, one week widen.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound widened in a very liquid private sector market on Thursday to between 9 3/4 and 10 3/8 percent from Wednesday's range of 9 7/8 and 10 3/16 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>The bankers said one-week rates also widened to between 10 and 10 1/2 against 10 and 10 1/8 percent on Wednesday.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
